#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:1 aed77c6bf1774b0e9a38f08a871c99cd
msgid "案例分析"
msgstr "Case analysis"

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:3 e29a5b8677884030980cd049bb1f0fd6
msgid "对训练好的模型进行案例分析——查看单个学生的答题序列和知识状态变化。"
msgstr "Perform case analysis on a trained model — inspect an individual student's response sequence and the evolution of their knowledge state."

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:5 7a174b7759154526bbe1931b6118d958
msgid "概述"
msgstr "Overview"

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:7 e32b817648fc492ca1d5303a152f67e5
msgid ""
"案例分析的目的是**可视化模型对具体学生的预测质量**：模型在哪里对了、哪里错了、知识状态如何演变。 它通过三步工作流完成：推理 → 筛选学生 →"
" 生成热力图。"
msgstr ""
"The goal of case analysis is to **visualize the prediction quality for specific students**: where the model was right, where it was wrong, and how the "
"knowledge state evolves. It follows a three-step workflow: inference → student selection →"
" heatmap generation."

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:15 1a5abd2ff30b4b12b90d7f3464f9f02e
msgid "快速上手"
msgstr "Quick start"

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:34 494d21be8ea14f038fddb564e6959711
msgid ""
"三步必须按顺序执行——``select`` 依赖 ``inference`` 产出的 "
"``predictions.parquet``，``plot`` 依赖 ``select`` 产出的 "
"``selected_users.json``。"
msgstr ""
"The three steps must be executed in order — ``select`` depends on the "
"``predictions.parquet`` produced by ``inference``, and ``plot`` depends on the "
"``selected_users.json`` produced by ``select``."

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:41 1d71637ea13c417893715176edb3f9bf
msgid "inference —— 批量推理"
msgstr "inference — Batch inference"

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:43 9f4a4b40165144bd8d328cda03575fa3
msgid "加载 ``best_model.pth``，用验证集跑前向推理，保存预测结果。"
msgstr "Loads ``best_model.pth``, runs forward inference on the validation set, and saves the predictions."

