#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:52 0af7b9a70ae5420c83b442bd39507f88
msgid ""
"执行流程：从 ``hyperparameters.json`` 读取模型名和数据集名 → 加载模型专属的 ``CaseAnalyzer`` → "
"遍历验证集批量推理 → 输出 parquet 文件。"
msgstr ""
"Execution flow: read the model name and dataset name from ``hyperparameters.json`` → load the model-specific ``CaseAnalyzer`` → "
"iterate over the validation set for batch inference → output a parquet file."

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:54 eebd7bac1cdb4c42bfb7cc89cbe52ea1
msgid "推理完成后在 ``run_dir/case_analysis/`` 下生成："
msgstr "After inference completes, the following is generated under ``run_dir/case_analysis/``:"

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:63 e61b913200be45ed8fc4fc27dcc9b4c3
msgid ""
"``CaseAnalyzer`` 继承 ``BaseTrainer``，但 ``build`` 只加载 checkpoint 不创建 "
"optimizer/loss——专为推理设计。如果 checkpoint 目录下没有 "
"``hyperparameters.json``，推理会直接报错。"
msgstr ""
"``CaseAnalyzer`` inherits from ``BaseTrainer``, but ``build`` only loads the checkpoint without creating an "
"optimizer/loss — it is purpose-built for inference. If there is no "
"``hyperparameters.json`` in the checkpoint directory, inference raises an error immediately."

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:70 d6181b9bc33442ee860b7c1539cc9a95
