msgstr "Maximum error rate"

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:84 9479776bdc544c79bd3e20259cf9bbd7
msgid "三种策略"
msgstr "The three strategies"

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:86 04a94c70071e4158bdcfa1d26970f953
msgid ""
"**diverse（多样采样，默认）**：将学生按错误率分 5 个桶（very_low → "
"very_high），从每个桶均匀采样，覆盖不同能力层次。"
msgstr ""
"**diverse (diverse sampling, default)**: splits students into 5 buckets by error rate (very_low → "
"very_high), sampling evenly from each bucket to cover different ability levels."

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:94 d130e872f1ce4ee684386b27fad9977d
msgid "**extreme（极端案例）**：选择错误率最高的学生，适合分析模型失败模式。"
msgstr "**extreme (extreme cases)**: selects students with the highest error rate, suitable for analyzing model failure modes."

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:102
#: 552dcc42eda64a24b192a7034377f838
msgid "**random（随机采样）**：从符合条件的候选中随机抽取，适合快速抽查。"
msgstr "**random (random sampling)**: randomly samples from qualifying candidates, suitable for quick spot checks."

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:110
#: e5ebff4142ac4329b3e4768a950e0aae
msgid "筛选逻辑"
msgstr "Selection logic"

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:112
#: 21add29bd4624109854c3c9dc944f6e4
msgid "计算所有学生的 ``num_attempts`` / ``error_rate`` / ``avg_confidence``"
msgstr "Compute ``num_attempts`` / ``error_rate`` / ``avg_confidence`` for all students"

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:113
#: ebab74645ec54a28ac8bbbfc5f5f77dc
msgid ""
"过滤掉 ``num_attempts < min_seq_len``、``error_rate`` 不在 ``[min_error, "
"max_error]`` 或 ``avg_confidence`` 不在 ``[0.3, 0.95]`` 的学生"
msgstr ""
"Filter out students with ``num_attempts < min_seq_len``, an ``error_rate`` outside ``[min_error, "
"max_error]``, or an ``avg_confidence`` outside ``[0.3, 0.95]``"

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:114
#: 680aee85d57e4a49ba968aaaa639e34a
msgid "符合条件不足 ``num_users`` 则全部返回，否则按策略采样"
msgstr "If fewer than ``num_users`` qualify, return all of them; otherwise sample according to the strategy"

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:116
#: 285b4061518941e79323fdd5a24970ed
msgid "结果保存到 ``run_dir/case_analysis/<strategy>/selected_users.json``。"
msgstr "Results are saved to ``run_dir/case_analysis/<strategy>/selected_users.json``."

