#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:62 f0f1cdf973b942b989aedd779d065296
msgid "每个技能的知识状态值（绿=高，红=低）"
msgstr "Knowledge state value for each skill (green = high, red = low)"

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:157
#: fc202c791a8842bb816de636dd98a755
msgid ""
"图片保存为 "
"``run_dir/case_analysis/<strategy>/figures/user_<user_id>_heatmap.png``，300"
" DPI。"
msgstr ""
"Images are saved as "
"``run_dir/case_analysis/<strategy>/figures/user_<user_id>_heatmap.png`` at 300"
" DPI."

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:160
#: 81153783b2854fefa76cda206d5d77f0
msgid ""
"热力图需要 ``knowledge_states`` 列。大多数 DKT 类模型会将隐藏状态作为知识状态输出。如果该列全为 "
"``None``，``plot`` 会报错。"
msgstr ""
"The heatmap requires the ``knowledge_states`` column. Most DKT-style models output the hidden state as the knowledge state. If this column is entirely "
"``None``, ``plot`` raises an error."

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:165
#: b219bcd872884e63b7eb4692c9d3bc00
msgid "自定义案例选择"
msgstr "Custom case selection"

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:167
#: cbd8b7dd621840c7af627648c5c1f49d
msgid "可以直接用 ``ResultCollector`` 在 Python 中自定义筛选："
msgstr "You can use ``ResultCollector`` directly in Python to customize the selection:"

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:187
#: 02bb7231029847c6b5ae4efba4732d68
msgid "完整输出结构"
msgstr "Full output structure"

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:206
#: 3b93288d2691487fbb34652c0be39d1e
msgid "模型支持"
msgstr "Model support"

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:208
#: f9df27d30deb4a208689fae78dc3dd5e
msgid ""
"模型需要实现 ``@register_analyzer(\"NAME\")`` 并继承 "
"``BaseCaseAnalyzer``（``utils/case_analysis/base_analyzer.py`` ），实现一个方法："
msgstr ""
"A model must implement ``@register_analyzer(\"NAME\")`` and inherit from "
"``BaseCaseAnalyzer`` (``utils/case_analysis/base_analyzer.py``), implementing one method:"

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:224
#: 846217cd9c694e86bed678672194810b
msgid "已有 34 个模型中的大部分实现了该方法。新模型参考 ``model/DKT/DKT_analyzer.py`` 创建即可。"
msgstr "Most of the 34 existing models already implement this method. For a new model, follow ``model/DKT/DKT_analyzer.py``."

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:227
#: 543542efc20c47cc844fa42ea64a8c9b
msgid "最佳实践"
msgstr "Best practices"

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:229
#: 62f89901c308400692b8a2024218157b
msgid "**先看 extreme**：找到模型表现最差的学生，优先修复失败模式"
msgstr "**Start with extreme**: find the students where the model performs worst, and prioritize fixing failure modes"

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:230
#: 95b4fc3873b54fd390bac1496b15803d
msgid "**再看 diverse**：覆盖不同能力层次，确认修复没有引入退化"
msgstr "**Then look at diverse**: cover different ability levels and confirm the fix did not introduce regressions"

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:231
#: 55bcf0a02d6b4d03a5ed8c51cb70d06b
msgid "**对比不同模型**：同一数据集、同一学生，对比两个模型的热力图"
msgstr "**Compare different models**: for the same dataset and student, compare the heatmaps of two models"

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:232
#: 6ba09e78c831405b9328e220e0b6206f
msgid "**截断长序列**：答题数超过 100 时用 ``--max_seq_len 100``，避免热力图过宽"
msgstr "**Truncate long sequences**: when there are more than 100 responses, use ``--max_seq_len 100`` to avoid an overly wide heatmap"
